A||||6||John Johnston||Headers and aftermarket exhaust
Z||000000||John Johnston||02-25-99||10:01 PM||||I have a small exhaust leak in the manifold area. I was wondering if anyone had had any experience with installing the headers and performance exhaust systems sold by The Fiero Store or FOCOA? Do they result in appreciable increase in horsepower? Or would I be better off looking for a used manifold, if one of mine is cracked?
Z||000001||John Johnston||02-25-99||10:03 PM||||Re: Headers and aftermarket exhaust: I forgot to mention that I have an 1987 2.8L GT
Z||000002||benjamin||02-26-99||02:18 AM||||about headers <p>i installed a set on my 87 gt along w/the fiero shops hi flow exhaust. w/patience and alot of scrapped knuckles, thrown wrenches and others tools went pretty well. :)<p>they made a big improvement in power and responce. i would recomend them to you and any one elsealong w/the ehaust sys.<p>any other ?'s call or e-mail me <p>mbenjamin4@aol.com<br>(937) 372-1673<br>(937) 372-4611 if busy im me because i'm on the computer.<p>benjamin marshall<br>
Z||000003||Cliff Pennock||02-26-99||04:51 AM||||Yes, that's what I've heared also from people who had installed the Sprint Headers. The original headers seem to have some accessive metal inside that is severely restricting exhaust flow.
Z||000004||black86gt||03-13-99||09:43 AM||||I am also looking to put on some nice headers. Any suggestions on brand and model?  What am I looking at for hp and torque gains?  How much money?  Is it hard?  Can you give me some instructions?  I can see most of the bolts up top there, but what about down below?  And about how long are we talking for the job if I go slow?  Thanks.
Z||000005||Pretender||03-23-99||01:36 AM||||i have installed the ocelot performance exhaust system and the cat replacement pipe from the "fiero store"...it's probably just me but i didn't feel any difference...for the price i thought it should of been mandrel bends not a restrictive crimped design...The muffler isn't the best sounding thing in the world either..i plan on making my own exhaust system from mandrel bent piping from summit(www.summitracing.com)...over all i thought i waisted my money...but thats just my opinion.................
